| UC-PRED-01 | PDU Data Prediction | Client / UI | Requests ML-powered predictions for future PDU activity based on historical time-series data using linear regression models |
| UC-PRED-02 | Natural Language Queries | Client / UI | Submits natural language questions about DIS platform data and receives intelligent responses via RAG system |
| UC-PRED-03 | Real-time Data Analysis | Client / UI | Requests AI-powered analysis of current system status, PDU rates, and platform performance metrics |
| UC-PRED-04 | Vector Similarity Search | Internal | Performs semantic similarity search across historical data and system knowledge for contextual responses |
| UC-PRED-05 | Conversational AI Interface | Client / UI | Engages in multi-turn conversations about DIS data with context-aware responses and follow-up capabilities |
| UC-PRED-06 | System Status Intelligence | Client / UI | Provides intelligent interpretation of system health, performance trends, and operational insights |
| UC-PRED-07 | Data Exploration Assistance | Client / UI | Assists users in exploring and understanding complex DIS simulation data through natural language interactions |
| UC-PRED-08 | Provide Health Status | Kubernetes, Kong Gateway | Provides health check endpoints for Kubernetes probes and Kong Gateway routing |

## API Endpoints

### Public Endpoints (No Authentication Required)

**Health Check**
- GET /api/prediction/health
- GET /health
- Response: Service health status for Kubernetes probes and monitoring

**Chat System Status**
- GET /api/prediction/chat/status
- Response: RAG system status, data availability, and model readiness information

### Protected Endpoints (Firebase JWT Required via Kong Gateway)

**ML Prediction Endpoint**
- POST /api/prediction
- POST /predict
- Request Body: {"timeUnit": "hour|day|week", "buckets": [{"hour": "timestamp", "entityStatePduCount": number, ...}]}
- Response: {"predicted_labels": ["Pred. Point 1", ...], "predicted_values": [numbers]}
- Headers: Authorization: Bearer {firebase_jwt_token} (validated by Kong Gateway)

**RAG Chat Interface**
- POST /api/prediction/chat
- POST /chat
- Request Body: {"query": "Natural language question about DIS data"}
- Response: {"query": "string", "answer": "string", "context": "string", "data_sources": ["list"], "timestamp": "string"}
- Headers: Authorization: Bearer {firebase_jwt_token} (validated by Kong Gateway)

## Technical Implementation

### Flask Application Architecture
- predict_v5.py: Main Flask application with ML prediction and RAG endpoints
- Modular design with separate prediction and RAG functionality
- Error handling and validation for all API endpoints
- JWT token extraction and forwarding for service authentication
- Health check endpoints for Kubernetes integration

### Machine Learning Components
**Predictive Analytics:**
- Linear Regression: scikit-learn models for time-series PDU prediction
- Feature Engineering: Automatic aggregation of 10+ PDU types for analysis
- Time-series Processing: Support for hourly, daily, and weekly prediction intervals
- Model Training: Dynamic model fitting based on historical data patterns

**RAG System Architecture:**
- DISDataRAGSystem: Comprehensive RAG implementation in rag_system.py
- Retrieval Component: Sentence-transformers for semantic embedding generation
- Generation Component: FLAN-T5-small for natural language response generation
- Vector Store: FAISS for efficient similarity search and retrieval
- Context Management: Intelligent context extraction and relevance scoring

### AI/ML Technology Stack
**Core ML Libraries:**
- torch==2.1.0: PyTorch for deep learning model execution
- transformers==4.35.0: Hugging Face transformers for NLP models
- sentence-transformers==2.2.2: Sentence embeddings for semantic similarity
- scikit-learn==1.3.0: Traditional ML algorithms for prediction
- faiss-cpu==1.7.4: Vector database for similarity search

**Supporting Libraries:**
- numpy==1.24.3: Numerical computing and array operations
- Flask==2.3.3: Web framework for API endpoints
- requests==2.31.0: HTTP client for service-to-service communication
- gunicorn==21.2.0: WSGI server for production deployment

### Data Processing and Caching
- Real-time Data Fetching: HTTP integration with Data Acquisition Service
- Data Caching: 2-second cache duration for real-time metrics optimization
- JWT Token Management: Dynamic token setting and authentication forwarding
- Error Handling: Comprehensive exception handling for service unavailability
- Vector Store Management: Efficient embedding storage and retrieval

### RAG System Features
**Natural Language Understanding:**
- Query Processing: Intelligent parsing of user questions and intent recognition
- Context Retrieval: Semantic search across platform data and system knowledge
- Response Generation: Contextual answer generation using transformer models
- Multi-turn Conversations: Context-aware dialogue management

**Data Integration:**
- Service Discovery: Dynamic endpoint configuration for platform services
- Authentication Flow: JWT token propagation for secure service access
- Real-time Updates: Live data integration for current system status
- Knowledge Base: Vector embeddings of platform documentation and data patterns

