## Deployment Configuration

### Container Specifications
- Image: ghcr.io/nus-iss-projects/cap-pdu-prediction/cap-pdu-prediction:latest
- Ports: HTTP 5001
- Resources: CPU 300m-1000m, Memory 1.5Gi-2Gi, Ephemeral Storage 2Gi-3Gi
- Health Probes: /health (180s readiness, 180s liveness initial delay for ML model loading)

### Environment Variables
- FLASK_ENV: production
- PYTHONUNBUFFERED: 1
- DIS_BASE_URL: http://kong-gateway-service.default.svc.cluster.local:8000

### Horizontal Pod Autoscaling
- HPA Configuration: 1 replica (fixed), 70% CPU + 85% Memory monitoring
- Single-instance deployment for ML model state consistency
- No automatic scaling to maintain model coherence and performance

